3. If you also have `/themes/''/templates/checkout/_partials/order-confirmation-table-simple.tpl`, apply the same code there (express checkout).

Like 1.7, the basket uses `svn1`/`svn2` and `{$products_json nofilter}`. The controller block differs from 1.7 — PrestaShop 8 uses array short syntax and `OrderPresenter`.

If several Kelkoo Group campaigns run for the same website (multiple MerchantIds), you can set them all up within the same tag. The `merchantInfo` variable takes this structure:

```
merchantInfo : [
  {
    country:'fr',
    merchantId:'12941513'
  },
  {
    country:'uk',
    merchantId:'56789'
  }
]
```

The same structure is documented identically on the PrestaShop 1.6x, 1.7x and 8 pages. On 1.6 remember `merchantInfo` sits inside `{literal}...{/literal}` tags.

Afterwards clear the cache: **Admin > Advanced Paramaters > Performance > Clear Cache**.
